This package distributes a TextMate grammar for PDDL adapted from the
`vscode-pddl` extension by Jan Dolejsi, licensed under the MIT License:

  https://github.com/jan-dolejsi/vscode-pddl

The original grammar JSON was modified only to:

  - normalize the `name` field to lowercase ("pddl")
  - add an `aliases` array (["PDDL"])
  - set `fileTypes` to ["pddl"]

so that fenced code blocks tagged ```pddl match correctly under Shiki /
Expressive Code.

